.TH "intel_error_decode" "1" "2016-03-01" "igt-gpu-tools 2.5" "General Commands Manual"
.SH "نام (NAME)"
intel_error_decode \- Decode an Intel GPU dump automatically captured by the kernel at the time of an error
.SH "خلاصه دستور (SYNOPSIS)"
.sp
\fBintel_error_decode\fP [\fIFILENAME\fP]
.SH "توضیحات (DESCRIPTION)"
.sp
\fBintel_error_decode\fP is a tool that decodes the instructions and state of the
GPU at the time of an error. It requires kernel 2.6.34 or newer, and either
debugfs mounted on /sys/kernel/debug or /debug containing a current
i915_error_state or you can pass a file containing a saved error.
.SH ARGUMENTS
.INDENT 0.0
.TP
.B FILENAME
Decodes a previously saved error.
.UNINDENT
.SH "گزارش باگ‌ها (REPORTING BUGS)"
.sp
